{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/d423c7712a8c1c70131f1a3af49db4a1.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m <strong>Rookie</strong>, the new guy on the space courier ship <strong>BallEx</strong>. Life onboard was already chaotic, but after crashing on a hostile planet, it\u2019s up to me to recover the lost cargo and the parts we need to get the ship flying again\u2026 assuming the crew doesn\u2019t drive me insane first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/be0a3ad4f981bfb530fb7f5d082fc0de.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least I\u2019m not completely alone. <strong>H.A.P.P.Y.</strong>, the ship\u2019s over-eager AI, insists on tagging along. With its \u201chelp,\u201d I shift tetrominos to reshape the terrain, blast enemies when things get hairy, and puzzle my way through whatever obstacles this planet throws at me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, I stumble across eccentric crewmates and passengers, uncover secrets best left buried, and try to keep what\u2019s left of my sanity. The game is turn-based, which gives me time to plan every move\u2026 though if I overthink it, I\u2019ll probably just dig myself into a hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/7caf910cd651e4b21270341e5422649f.avif?t=1759849293\" width=1176 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds chapter by chapter, each one packed with new puzzles, hazards, and plenty of questionable life choices. <strong>Chapter 1</strong> is just the beginning \u2014 and trust me, the crew has more ways to ruin my day than this planet ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/storepage_footer?t=1759849293\" /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crash landed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/68044f21be01076209a62c2561c8a534ef03ec67.jpg"},{"name":"Kiss from a drone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/fdbbab54e49a37c7e5ab59f62c2c4555daec5ff4.jpg"},{"name":"Drony, Drona, Dronu?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/90061e48e576231928349ab0ec320bc87bf2caa3.jpg"},{"name":"Nexus Field I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/0d7ba9d0cc79bc23d548ad0993732868e62645a9.jpg"},{"name":"Monolith I Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/873677e63a7cfb69802de17d188c181ff22909f0.jpg"},{"name":"Let The Music Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/dc41f1ea2298d9d3404fe95c73725a04b8fe7b36.jpg"},{"name":"Plant a tree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/a3fba0fe325bc2c4dfa4d0ee49018c39b7de576c.jpg"},{"name":"50cc Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/396578106bbff51d73891eabb799958de341e051.jpg"},{"name":"100cc Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1349680/dcba02e295c5de9b13fb5aa5583251c7f22e5c93.jpg"},{"name":"150cc Grand Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image